for surgery</article-title><source>J Neurosurg</source><year>2006</year><volume>104</volume><fpage>383</fpage><lpage>7</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16776372</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B5"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kamada</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Isu</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Houkin</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Ohsato</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Katoh</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Kojima</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Acute aggravation of subdural effusion associated with pachymeningitis carcinomatosa: case report</article-title><source>Neurosurgery</source><year>1991</year><volume>29</volume><fpage>464</fpage><lpage>6</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1922720</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00006123-199109000-00025</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tseng</surname><given-names>SH</given-names></name><name><surname>Liao</surname><given-names>CC</given-names></name><name><surname>Lin</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name><name><surname>Chen</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Shun</surname><given-names>CT</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Dural metastasis in patients with malignant neoplasm and chronic subdural hematoma</article-title><source>Acta Neurol Scand</source><year>2003</year><volume>108</volume><fpage>43</fpage><lpage>6</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12807392</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1034/j.1600-0404.2003.00080.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kunii</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Morita</surname><given-n